<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Slices on Quy Duong Minh — Software Engineer</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/tags/slices/</link><description>Recent content in Slices on Quy Duong Minh — Software Engineer</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>vi-VN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://quydmfl.github.io/tags/slices/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>05. Slice &amp; Array nội bộ</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/05-slice-array-noi-bo/</link><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/05-slice-array-noi-bo/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Slice là cấu trúc dữ liệu dùng nhiều nhất trong Go, và cũng là nguồn bug âm thầm phổ biến nhất — vì slice không phải mảng, nó là 1 &amp;ldquo;view&amp;rdquo; (con trỏ + length + capacity) trỏ vào 1 underlying array có thể &lt;strong&gt;bị chia sẻ&lt;/strong&gt; giữa nhiều slice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="slice-là-gì-bên-dưới-pointer--len--cap"&gt;Slice là gì bên dưới: pointer + len + cap&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; []&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;{&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;] &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// slicing tạo view, không copy dữ liệu&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Printf&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;a: %v, len=%d, cap=%d\n&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;, len(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;), cap(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;))
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Printf&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;b: %v, len=%d, cap=%d\n&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;, len(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;), cap(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;))
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Địa chỉ b[0] có trùng địa chỉ a[1]?&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;] &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;])&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;a: [1 2 3 4 5], len=5, cap=5
b: [2 3], len=2, cap=4
Địa chỉ b[0] có trùng địa chỉ a[1]? true&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;true&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — &lt;code&gt;b[0]&lt;/code&gt; và &lt;code&gt;a[1]&lt;/code&gt; là &lt;strong&gt;cùng 1 ô nhớ&lt;/strong&gt;. Chú ý cả &lt;code&gt;cap(b) = 4&lt;/code&gt;, không phải &lt;code&gt;2&lt;/code&gt; (bằng &lt;code&gt;len(b)&lt;/code&gt;): slicing giữ nguyên phần capacity còn lại của underlying array tính từ điểm bắt đầu, không cắt gọn theo &lt;code&gt;len&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>